    <title>Paul McCartney</title>
    <sub-title>A MusiCaresTribute</sub-title>
    <desc>The unmistakable Paul McCartney was honored as "Person of the Year" by MusiCares at a gala event that brought together several artists to celebrate the Beatles' victorious career.</desc>
